        "Entry reset — shoes racked, coats hung, backpacks staged",
        "Bathroom 2-minute wipe — sink, mirror, towels hung straight",
        "Mail opened standing over the recycling bin",
        "Unload the van — nothing sleeps in it, nothing lands on the counter"
